test "rank1980: a case action without a directive lowers its calls"
  lang c
  file hex_grammar.c
  expect VYQL-INJ-002
  code
  ```
  #include <stdlib.h>

  extern char* getenv(const char* name);
  extern int yyn;

  int yyparse(void* yyscanner, const char* name)
  {
    switch (yyn)
      {
      case 4:
        {
          char* cmd = getenv(name);
          system(cmd);
        }
        break;
      }
    return 0;
  }
  ```

